Write a pseudo-code function `findProductsByPriceInCategories(categoryID, minPrice)` that returns a list of product IDs. The function should traverse the category tree starting from `categoryID` and collect all product IDs from that category and its descendants whose prices are >= `minPrice`. You can use the following helper functions:
  - `getCategoryDetails(id)`: Returns { subCategoryIDs: [id1, id2, ...], productIDs: [prodId1, prodId2, ...] }
  - `getProductPrice(productID)`: Returns the numerical price of the product.
